sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Circles - join, share and feedback
    accDescr: The owner creates a circle and an invite code; a friend joins; a player shares a prepared video with optional 3D motion; members watch with 60 second grants and comment at video moments.
    autonumber
    actor O as Circle owner
    actor M as Member
    participant App as iOS app
    participant API as FootyLevels API
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant SB as Supabase
    O->>App: Create circle
    App->>API: POST /api/circles
    O->>App: Invite
    App->>API: POST /api/circles/id/invite
    API->>FS: Store SHA-256 of a new 43-character code, 7 day expiry
    API-->>App: Code to send privately
    M->>App: Enter code
    App->>API: POST /api/circles/join
    API->>FS: Add member with a new generation, max 20 members
    M->>App: Share a ready video, skill, note, optional 3D motion and earlier attempt
    App->>API: POST /api/circles/id/posts with Idempotency-Key
    API->>FS: Recheck membership, pin video, revision and motion
    O->>App: Open the post
    App->>API: POST /api/circles/id/posts/pid/assets and motion-assets
    API-->>App: Signed reads valid 60 s, rechecked after signing
    App->>SB: Download video and motion
    O->>App: Comment at 2.4 s
    App->>API: POST /api/circles/id/posts/pid/comments with text and timestamp
    M->>App: Read feedback, jump to the moment, record a new attempt
